; YM2203 FM/SSG on the song's own Timer B ticks: T169 = 99.617 BPM, 24 ticks per quarter (T estimated from write timing).
; Pitch = PMD note + D detune; volume changes inside notes are tied pieces (FM V, SSG v).
; Vibrato that PMD's own LFO reproduces is written as M/*1, other pitch movement as per-tick D.
